OL,3,GNEWSAWhy parts of the West look like
OL,4,Aautumn already
OL,5,
OL,6,FProfessor Mark Everard, from the
OL,7,FUniversity of the West of England
OL,8,F(UWE), said while there are "winners
OL,9,Fand losers" in nature, it is important
OL,10,Fto see it as "a highly integrated
OL,11,Fmachine that's breaking down".
